Preview by default; --confirm revokes credentials without cancelling mail work

Usage: mxr serve clients revoke [OPTIONS] <CLIENT_ID>

Arguments:
  <CLIENT_ID>

Options:
      --dry-run
      --confirm
      --format <FORMAT>  Structured output (json or jsonl) [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help             Print help
